    <string name="about_title">About</string>
    <string name="about_purpose">QFit is a step simulator: on this phone, it writes steps, distance, and exercise to Health Connect for other health or game apps to read. No Google sign-in. Your account is never given to the developer.</string>
    <string name="about_disclaimer">Disclaimer: QFit writes simulated step data for personal testing and entertainment only. Follow the terms of any downstream app or game. The developer does not guarantee third-party rewards, behavior, or account safety. Use at your own risk.</string>
