    <string name="about_tagline">No sign-in. On-device permissions only. Nothing uploaded to the developer.</string>

    <string name="rationale_title">Why Health Connect is needed</string>
    <string name="rationale_body">QFit writes steps, distance, and exercise on this phone so other health apps can read them. It does not sign in or send your Google account to the developer.</string>

